OL,8,G0230FBBC News Summary
OL,9,G0232FThe Climate Question
OL,10,     GHave you considered the carbon
OL,11,     Gfootprint of war: the bombs, the
OL,12,     Gjets, and the network of military
OL,13,     Gbases? How does that impact our
OL,14,     Gplanet? And how could the
OL,15,     Gmilitary decarbonise?
OL,16,G0300FBBC News
OL,17,G0306FOutlook
OL,18,     GWith 1,000 freeze dried meals, a
OL,19,     Gphilospher, a craftsman and an
OL,20,     Gengineer set off to row across
OL,21,     Gthe world's largest ocean. The
OL,22,     GPacific was waiting for them.
